---
import SaturdayShuffle from "./SaturdayShuffle";
---

<section id="off-clock" class="scroll-mt-28 py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <header class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-end">
      <div class="max-w-xl">
        <p class="act-kicker">Off the clock</p>
        <h2 class="act-title">The part that isn&apos;t on the résumé.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-sm text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
        Two dogs, one creek, and a notes app that won&apos;t stay closed. This is the material the
        résumé has no field for.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-5">
      <div class="lg:col-span-3">
        <div class="art-frame" data-reveal>
          <img
            src="/art/dogs.jpg"
            alt="Barkley and Margo, two scruffy German Shepherd–poodle mixes, sitting together on a dock at golden hour"
            width="1184"
            height="880"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="mt-5 flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-white">Barkley &amp; Margo</h3>
          <p class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-gray-600">Scale: 1,100 walks</p>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-400">
          Two German Shepherd–poodle mixes, one house, zero shortage of personality. They are why
          my walks have a route and my afternoons have a deadline.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <div class="art-frame h-full min-h-[16rem]" data-reveal>
          <img
            src="/art/shem-creek.jpg"
            alt="Shrimp boats moored on Shem Creek at sunset, golden marsh grass and a warm sky"
            width="1248"
            height="832"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-white">
          Shem Creek, most evenings
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-400">
          Mt. Pleasant pace, Charleston energy. The reset button is a dock, some salt air, and
          Erica pretending not to laugh at whatever I just said about tire strategy.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-5">
      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <SaturdayShuffle client:idle />
      </div>

      <div class="glass-card rounded-[2rem] p-8 lg:col-span-3">
        <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#FF5A1F]">
          Also true
        </p>
        <dl class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div>
            <dt class="font-display text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white">Curiosity</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400">
              I don&apos;t know everything yet — I treat that as a short-term problem.
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="font-display text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white">Side projects</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400">
              Tiny tools, agent workflows, and ideas that refuse to stay in my notes app.
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="font-display text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white">F1 &amp; football</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400">
              Watched with the same intensity I bring to a deal review. Louder, usually.
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="font-display text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white">Just keep livin&apos;</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400">
              And finding the green lights — on the track, and everywhere else.
            </dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
